/T (If you need to cancel or reschedule a service, please contact your Care Partner and Care Delivery Team during regular weekday hours. For public holidays or urgent matters, our after-hours service is available to assist you. We request that you provide at least 24 hours' notice for cancellations to avoid any late charges. You can reach us on homecare@salveocare.com.au or by calling 1800 725 836 Option 3.)
